  destruct HX as (bm & bd & stack & buf & HC & HS & x & Hx & HW & HB & HCL & HR).
  destruct (PSB.leaf_state I i c k ps1 _ pv lv pe ce d E1 R1 E' R' M1 M' model1 bm bd stack buf IL LD HAt HA Hag HLF HC)
    as (_ & HK & _ & LL1 & LL2 & LL3 & LL4 & LL5 & LL6 & LL7 & (AG1 & AG2 & AG3) & LL8 & LL9 & LL10 & LL11 & LL12 & LL13 & LL14 & LL15 & LL16 & HSB & FR2 & FRI & HPAX & Hden & HEQ).
  pose proof HC as (HC1 & HC2 & HC3 & HC4 & HC5 & HC6 & HC6b & HC7 & HC8 & HC9).
