  - apply andb_prop in Kcls as [Kcls Kd0]. apply andb_prop in Kcls as [Kcls K5]. apply andb_prop in Kcls as [Kp Kin]. apply Z.eqb_eq in Kp. apply Z.leb_le in K5.
