    destruct L_facts as (Lt & Lh & Ls & Lp & Lj & Li & Lne & Lm).
    cbv iota in MV. destruct MV as (MV1 & MV2 & MV3 & MV4 & MV5).
    destruct (curj_val E1 (uv E1 (EVar 49)) MV4 MV2 pv d0 D0) as (CJ1 & CJ2).
